  alienOnScreen: {fileID: 0}
  tabletAnimsScript: {fileID: 0}
  queen: {fileID: 1603048764201989246, guid: 032e84ce436a7144cb1797cfdbbb1e52, type: 3}
  aliensInLocation0: []
  aliensInLocation1: []
  aliensInLocation2: []
  aliensInLocation3: []
  aliensInLocation4: []
  aliensInLocation5: []
  retriedAlready: 0
  alienBios:
  - "Looking for someone to live life in the fast lane with. \nLikes: Extreme Sports.
    Dislikes: Talking about 'The Incident.'"
  - "I\u2019m looking for a down to earth, easy to talk to partner who just wants
    to relax in the sun all day. \nLikes: Positive vibes. Dislikes: Physical Touch"
  - "Just looking for someone who accepts me for who I am, no matter what I look
    like. \nLikes: Physical Touch. Dislikes: Being called short."
  - "I need someone to help me through my life struggles. I'm 60 feet tall so I have
    many struggles. \nLikes: A kind person. Dislikes: Being touched."
  - 'Hey! I''m Flyynt!  I''ve got the best rock collection in the galaxy!

    Likes:
    Rocks. Dislikes: Rock disrespect.'
  - "Tarrant is very lonely, Tarrant hasn't felt the touch of anyone in too long
    :((( Please swipe right!! :3 \nLikes: Hats!!! Dislikes: Being Judged :(("
  - "I'm blind and mute, but I dont need 20/20 vision to see that we'd be a great
    match! \nLikes: New things to feel. Dislikes: Ableism."
  - "I know you won't swipe anyway... I'm too ugly... If we match, I know it was
    probably an accident... \nLikes: Praise. Dislikes: People who think they know
    what's best for me."
  - 'Pick me! I''m not like the other Glorps on this app! I''m naturally pretty!

    Likes:
    Compliments. Dislikes: Being like the other fairies.'
  - "Umm... Hi.... I'm just... looking for someone gentle... \nLikes: Kind people.
    Dislikes: Extroverts."
  - "Yes, I am the real Finona the Celebrity. No, I'm not a fan account. No, I'm
    not a bot. \nLikes: Someone who's down to glorth. Dislikes: Smug Glorpholes."
  - 'I love Stargazing. I don''t talk to people much. I write poems lots.

    Likes:
    Stargazing Dislikes: Small Minded individuals.'
  - "I am Kaleen. I like cleaning. I am NOT a maid, I just have standards. \nLikes:
    Clean-ing. Dislikes: Dirty people."
  - "SHABANG! Your wish has come true, You have found your perfect match, Me! \nLikes:
    Running along the beach freely! Dislikes: Overly touchy people."
  - "We have an open position in the relationship department and we think you would
    be a great candidate. \nLikes: Business tips. Dislikes: Not Safe For Work content."
  - 'In the unlikely chance I match with you, I am looking for a spouse to settle
    down with, someone who will rule side by side me.

    Likes: Honesty, comfort
    and integrity. Dislikes: Humans.'
  getRetryLocation: 0
